#. i18n: file: ui/imapsettings.ui:84
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, hostEdit)
#: rc.cpp:220
msgid ""
"The address of the mail server, e.g. mail.yourprovider.org. You should get "
